OL,3,GNEWSAScammer impersonates Christmas
OL,4,Amarket organisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scammer is contacting traders and
OL,7,Fpurporting to take bookings for a
OL,8,FChristmas market, according to a town
OL,9,Fcouncil.
OL,11,FProspective stall holders reported
OL,12,Fbeing contacted and invited to apply
OL,13,Ffor a pitch at Farnham Christmas Market
OL,14,Fin Surrey.
OL,16,FBut Farnham Town Council, which is the
OL,17,Flegitimate organiser of the event, said
OL,18,Fit had not sent the emails.
